{"sourceUrl":"https://cs.cug.edu.cn/info/1021/11791.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:01.386083+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://cs.cug.edu.cn/info/1021/11791.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<div><p><span>中国地质大学（武汉）计算机学院是莘莘学子成长的摇篮、专业技能锻造的熔炉、核心价值观养成的沃土、追求学术卓越的基地。学院始建于1985年，建有6个本科专业，其中“计算机科学与技术”“软件工程”“空间信息与数字技术”专业入选国家级一流本科专业建设点。计算机学科、软件学科在2017年教育部全国学</span><span>科评估中为B档，2026年计算机学科在ESI全球排名中位于前1.03‰。</span></p><p><span><span>学院的优势学科方向包括数据挖掘、人工智能、遥感大数据、计算机视觉、网络安全、空间信息处理、地理空间信息系统、地学信息领域软件工程等。学院建有华为、阿里巴巴、腾讯、百度、绿盟、亚马逊、中船集团709研究所等多个产、学、研基地。近年来，学院继续完善项目依托、团队实施、竞赛检验和学术互融的大学生创新创业体系；承办了多届全国高校移动互联网应用创新大赛，ICPC华中地区程序设计邀请赛等高水平科技赛事；并组织学生在国内多项大赛中获奖夺魁。</span></span></p><p><span><span>现将</span></span><span><span>学院</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年第</span></span><span><span>十二</span></span><span><span>届</span></span><span><span>研招</span></span><span><span>校园开放日活动方案</span></span><span><span>通知</span></span><span><span>如下</span></span><span><span>：</span></span></p><p><span><span>一</span></span><span><span>、申请</span></span><span><span>对象及条件</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>凡有意报考我院硕士、博士学位研究生的考生均可申请。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span>二、</span><span><span>时间</span></span><span><span>及工作</span></span><span><span>安排</span></span><span></span></p><p><span>1．</span><span><span>学生报名：</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日—</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>30</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>（每日8:00-17:00）</span></span><span><span>，报名学生通过</span></span><span><span>学</span></span><span><span>校“</span></span><a href=\"http://epo.cug.edu.cn/Open/ZsTkssXly/Signin.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>研招校园开放日报名系统</span></span></a><span><span>”填报申请</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>报名网址：</span></span><a href=\"https://epo.cug.edu.cn/Open/ZsTkssXly/Signin.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>https://epo.cug.edu.cn/Open/ZsTkssXly/Signin.aspx</span></span></a><span></span></p><p><span><span>注意：未填写</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>申请院系</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>信息的，视为报名不成功。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span> </span><span><span>校园开放日活动时间为</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>日。</span></span><span><span>学院审核材料后，将于7月</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>日前邮件通知符合条件的学生参加活动。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>具体</span></span><span><span>活动</span></span><span><span>日程</span></span></p><p><span><span>我院研招校园开放日活动主要包括招生政策宣讲、学科解读、导师与学生互动交流等，</span></span><span><span>采用线上线下相结合的方式。外校学生采用线上形式（</span></span><span><span>WPS会议号</span></span><span><span>：212 344 0927</span></span><span><span>），本校学生采用线下形式。</span></span><span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span>日期</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>时间</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>地点（WPS会议号）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>活动内容</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>7月2日</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9:30-11:00</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>计算机学院323</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>WPS会议号</span></span><span><span>：212 344 0927</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>招生政策宣讲、学科解读以及导师与学生交流互动</span></span><span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span>注：1.</span></span><span><span>具体活动以现场安排为准，请关注相关通知</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p><p><span>2．</span><span><span>提前在设备上下载“WPS会议”APP，做好参会准备。</span></span></p><p><span><span>四、其他事项</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span> </span><span><span>参加研招校园开放日活动的学生必须遵守中国地质大学（武汉）相关规定，按照统一安排参加各项活动。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 本</span></span><span><span>次开放日活动仅为招生宣传，与招生选拔工作无关。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>五</span></span><span><span>、联系方式</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>招生单位</span></span><span><span>网址：</span></span><a href=\"https://cs.cug.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>https://cs.cug.edu.cn/</span></span></a><span></span></p><p><span><span>通讯地址：湖北省武汉东湖新技术开发区锦程街68号</span></span><span><span>中国地质大学（武汉）未来城校区计算机学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮政编码：430078，联系人：</span></span><span><span>李</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>办公室：</span></span><span><span>计算机学院307</span></span><span><span>，电话：027-65278770，</span></span></p><p><span><span>E-mail：</span></span><a href=\"mailto:yjs15@cug.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>yjs15@cug.edu.cn</span></span></a><span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>中国地质大学（武汉）<span>计算机学院</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>                    </span></span></span><span><span><span> <span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>                                    </span></span></span></p></div>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"5d5bb86bd8a755e9817267a4f33782e62aa4d89c043fd53d72470b3eb2447f58","textLength":1141,"sourceSha256":"f3c11d7832f9c2e1b1a7a3a909549504d6da06700a43beb258c8f17818e11fb3","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-148c9a1c30659be64d85","title":"2026年中国地质大学（武汉）计算机学院2026年第十二届研招校园开放日活动方案","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:01.386083+00:00"}
